3 Benchmarking Simplification Models for English Language
To select an appropriate baseline model for Estonian text simplification, we benchmarked established English simplification models with accessible and usable code. For this benchmarking, we followed the approach outlined by [23].
The first model to benchmark leverages machine translation (MT) techniques for text simplification. While MT systems are traditionally used to translate text between languages, the underlying technology—specifically sequence-to-sequence
